\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Certificate-price frontier} (matched $5$-seed means). All certificates are sound ($=1.0$); the exact paired Maurer--Pontil bound commits \emph  {about as many} mixtures as M2 ($0.260\approx 0.269$), while the tighter asymptotic normal bound nearly doubles coverage ($0.503$). Tightness trades against finite-sample rigor but never against soundness here.}}{5}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
